Ruth Tanaka of the Sable Ridge Sentinels answered for the bench.

:::quote{id=Q1}

The injury report is a real thing, and so is the one that took Cole Vandermeer out of the game. The Sentinels need a wide receiver by Sunday, and the wire is where that starts.

:::quote{id=Q2}

She does.

Dana Whitlock of the Gravel Pit Grinders was asked about the start.

:::quote{id=Q3}

Numbers desk has more on that. We reached out to Milltown Mudlarks and Ashgrove Anvils and did not hear back.
